cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use COPLA2, please cite it as below."
title: "COPLA2"
abstract: >-
  COPLA2 classifies plasmids into Plasmid Taxonomic Units (PTUs). It computes the
  average nucleotide identity (ANI) between the query plasmids and the plasmids of a
  reference database, inserts the queries into the reference network and assigns each
  one to a PTU with a nested stochastic block model.
type: software
